<title>CANADA: Derlan Q3 share net falls after writedown</title>
<headline>Derlan Q3 share net falls after writedown</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			 1995</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	 C$1.77   profit	C$1.80</p>
<p> Net	  loss	 31,542   profit	31,519</p>
<p> Revs			75,221		   97,818</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	C$1.87   profit	C$1.38</p>
<p> Net	   loss	31,973   profit	26,297</p>
<p> Revs		     228,601		  258,386</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Derlan Industries Ltd. The company said it reported a loss in the third quarter mainly because of a C$30 million write-down for underperforminng assets. --Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
